      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you draft a professional email to your tenants. Here's a possible version:\n\nSubject: Notification of HVAC Maintenance in Tokyo Office Building\n\nDear valued tenants,\n\nAs we strive to maintain the optimal comfort and efficiency of our Tokyo office building, our facilities team will be conducting routine maintenance on the HVAC system this weekend. This maintenance is essential to ensure the system's continued performance and longevity.\n\nPlease be advised that the temperature may fluctuate slightly during the maintenance period, which is expected to last for a few hours. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your understanding as we work to keep our building running smoothly.\n\nIf you have any specific requests or concerns regarding the maintenance, please don't hesitate to reach out to our facilities team. They will be happy to assist you.\n\nThank you for your cooperation and understanding.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n\nYou can also consider adding a sentence or two to explain what the tenants can expect during the maintenance period, such as:\n\n\"During the maintenance, the temperature may drop to around 18°C (64°F) for a short period, but it should return to normal once the work is completed.\"\n\nThis will help set expectations and alleviate any concerns the tenants may have.",
