      "content": "Here's a revised version with a more formal tone and the added detail about proactive maintenance:\n\nSubject: Notification of Scheduled HVAC Maintenance in Tokyo Office Building\n\nDear valued tenants,\n\nWe are writing to inform you that our facilities team will be conducting routine maintenance on the heating, ventilation, and air conditioning (HVAC) system in our Tokyo office building this weekend. This proactive maintenance is essential to ensure the continued optimal performance and stability of our building's systems, and to prevent any potential issues with air quality or temperature fluctuations that may arise in the future.\n\nThe maintenance is scheduled to take place on [Date] and is expected to last for approximately [Number] of hours. During this time, the temperature may fluctuate slightly, but we anticipate that it will return to normal once the work is completed.\n\nWe appreciate your understanding and cooperation in this matter, and assure you that this proactive maintenance will help to prevent any \"unexplained\" or \"unpredictable\" issues with air quality or temperature that may have arisen in the past. By taking proactive steps to maintain our systems, we are able to ensure a more stable and comfortable environment for all occupants.\n\nIf you have any specific requests or concerns regarding the maintenance, please do not hesitate to reach out to our",
